 * <li>http://www.vt100.net/docs/vt510-rm/chapter4</li>
 * <li>http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO/IEC_2022 - for 7-bit and 8-bit GL GR explanation</li>
 * <li>http://bjh21.me.uk/all-escapes/all-escapes.txt - extensive!</li>
